<title>JAPAN: Tunisia central bank launches 4.95% 15-yr samurais.</title>
<headline>Tunisia central bank launches 4.95% 15-yr samurais.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank of Tunisia on Thursday launched 15 billion yen worth of 4.95 percent 15-year samurai bonds due September 27, 2011, lead-manager Nikko Securities said.</p>
<p>The samurai bonds were priced at par, with twice-yearly coupon payments.  </p>
<p>The breakdown of the terms is as follows.</p>
<p> AMT 15 bln yen COUPON 4.95%	MATURITY Sept 27, 2011</p>
<p> TYPE samurai   ISS PRICE 100 yen PAY DATE Sept 27, 1996</p>
<p>SUB PERIOD  Sept 25 to Sept 26</p>
<p>SIGN DATE Sept 24</p>
<p>INTEREST PAYMENT March 27 and Sept 27</p>
<p>LAST RATING BBB+(JBRI)</p>
<p>LEAD MANAGER Nikko Securities</p>
<p>LEAD TRUSTEE N/A</p>
</text>
